  "title": "Knowtex, LACN, and MOASD Partnership",
  "summary": "Knowtex, a leader in voice AI workflows for healthcare, is thrilled to announce exciting new partnerships with Los Angeles Cancer Network (LACN) and Medical Oncology Associates of San Diego (MOASD). This collaboration underscores Knowtex’s commitment to enhancing oncology workflows with innovative voice AI solutions, while also providing the flexibility to support multispecialty needs for clinicians in fields such as gastrointestinal, gynecology, and urology care.",
